<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7580" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασύρω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pull up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Goth.</u>
					4.11
				</span></i>
			; another's clothes, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.110
			</span></i>; <i>expose to view,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀκρασίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Clearch.
					14
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>pull up one's clothes, expose one's person,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				11.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.85
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασυράμεναι τοὺς χιτωνίσκους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.248b
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			part.
			
				Pass.
			 as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασεσυρμένος</span>
			<i>obscene,</i> Anacr ap.Phot.<i><span class="en">
				p.123
			</span></i> R.; <i>lacking in decency,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Char.</u>
				6.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in 
				Pass.
			 also, of Alexander's hair, <i>to be curly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				12.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>plunder, ravage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.330d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
